  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Header.png\" alt=\"Pastel Shader's logo\" width=\"1024\" height=\"324\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ffe8e9&amp;labelColor=ffced2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=blue\" width=\"205\" height=\"26\" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SUPPORTS-IRIS,%20OCULUS,%20OPTIFINE%20|%201.7%20to%201.20-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"385\" height=\"28\" />&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/elocindev\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-SUPPORT%20ME-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Ko-Fi&amp;labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"212\" height=\"27\" /></a></em><em>&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/ELOCIN\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Promo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1018\" height=\"151\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Pastel Shaders 是一款具有多种颜色预设的风格化美学光影包</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066006073456197652/presets-transparent.gif\" alt=\"All three presets featured in Pastel Shaders\" width=\"1200\" height=\"608\" /><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066223943956041748/highperformance.png\" alt=\"Pastel is a high performance shader.\" width=\"1120\" height=\"567\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>🎨 多种颜色预设</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">从粉色、蓝色到黄色的粉彩调色板，供您选择！&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>🌌 宁静的氛围</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;提供接近原版的游戏体验，拥有清澈的星空。美丽的日落和日出。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>✏️ 高度可定制</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;无论是新手还是高级用户，自定义设置都非常简单且几乎不受限制！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>⚙️ 用户友好的设置菜单</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;选项太多让你不知所措？Pastel 拥有类似大多数现代游戏的快速设置。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">现代游戏。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>💻&nbsp;在大多数现代电脑上运行</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;即使对于现代低端显卡甚至集成显卡也进行了优化！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>☁️ <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/shader/insanity-shader\">Insanity Shaderpack</a> 的姊妹版</strong></span>\n<p>Pastel 是 Insanity 的对立面版本，它基于 BSL Shaders &hearts;！</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
